        {
          "text": "Maze Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki ahagararana na bagenzi biwe b’abaherezi na Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalitiyeli na bagenzi biwe, bubaka igicaniro c’ Imana y’Abisirayeli co kwoserezakw ibimazi, nk’uko vyanditswe mu vyagezwe vya Mose umuntu w’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
