        {
          "text": "Kandi bagerera abubatsi n’ababaji amahera, ab’i Sidoni n’ab’i Tiro babagerera ivyo kurya n’ibinyobga n’ amavuta, kugira ngo bazane ibiti vy’amasederi, babikūre i Lebanoni babizane ku kiyaga babishikane i Yopa, bakurikiye ibgirizwa ryashinzwe na Kuro Umwami w’i Buperesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
