        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu mwaka ugira kabiri uhereye aho bashikiye ku kibanza c’ingoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu, mu kwezi kwa kabiri, ni ho Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalitiyeli na Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki batanguriye gukora, bafatanije n’abandi bagenzi babo b’abaherezi n’ Abalewi, n’abavuye mu kinyago bose bakaza i Yerusalemu; bashirah’ Abalewi, uhereye ku bamaze imyaka mirongwibiri no kuja hejuru, kugira ngo bahagarikire igikorwa c’ingoro y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
