          "text": "Abubatsi bamaze kwubaka itanguriro ry’urusengero rw’Uhoraho, bashirah’ abaherezi, bambaye impuzu z’ubuherezi nyene, bafise inzumbete, n’Abalewi bo mu ba Asafu, bafise ivyo kuvuza vyitwa matowazi, ngo bahimbaze Uhoraho nk’uko vyagezwe na Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli. ",
